  "details": "I've had a heart in my status message for years. Over time, every heart character broke, and recently even <3 broke. There's no longer any way to depict the concept of \"heart\" in my status message. I'm so heartbroken :'-(\n\nHere are examples of heart characters which I would like to see whitelisted:\n\n♡ ♥ ❤ \n\nThese three characters are all possible to render in black&white without emoji support, so there is no technical limitation here. It's just an issue with backend sanitization.\n\nIf the DMV allows these characters in license plates, VRChat should permit them in social features, too.\n\n~❤ Lyuma",
